### 满 100 元减 10 元，12000 - 1000 = 11000 分
POST http://127.0.0.1:18080/api/checkout
Content-Type: application/json
X-Request-Id: idea-shopping-1

{"sku":"BOOK","quantity":2}

### 不满 100 元，应付 6000 分
POST http://127.0.0.1:18080/api/checkout
Content-Type: application/json
X-Request-Id: idea-shopping-2

{"sku":"BOOK","quantity":1}

### 数量非法，HTTP 400
POST http://127.0.0.1:18080/api/checkout
Content-Type: application/json
X-Request-Id: idea-shopping-invalid

{"sku":"PEN","quantity":0}

### 直接调用模拟支付接口（Gateway 会轮询 payment-1..4）
POST http://127.0.0.1:18080/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json
X-Request-Id: idea-payment-direct-1

{"orderId":"ORDER-DEMO-001","amountCents":11000}

### K8s：异步支付，立即返回 PAYMENT_PENDING
POST http://127.0.0.1:28080/api/checkout/async
Content-Type: application/json
X-Request-Id: idea-async-payment-1

{"sku":"BOOK","quantity":2}

### K8s：把上一个请求返回的 orderId 填到这里，查询 PXC 落库结果
GET http://127.0.0.1:28080/api/payments/orders/ORDER-REPLACE-ME
